From b9dec881ab6370ceee3f35826d6200767c5c5a91 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pieroviano <piero.viano@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 25 Jul 2026 03:20:27 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Sweep: TreeView/ListView/StatusBar event args, small support,
 converters

Additive types, signatures from the net48 reference:

- Event args: NodeLabelEditEventArgs, SearchForVirtualItemEventArgs,
  StatusBarDrawItemEventArgs (+ their delegate handlers).
- ListViewInsertionMark, OwnerDrawPropertyBag (with static Copy/IsEmpty),
  DockingAttribute, AmbientProperties.
- Ten type converters as minimal subclasses of the correct BCL base
  (ImageIndexConverter : Int32Converter, ImageKeyConverter : StringConverter,
  TreeView* : those, ColumnHeaderConverter : ExpandableObjectConverter, and the
  TypeConverter-based Cursor/Link/ListBinding/Padding/TreeNode converters). They
  exist so [TypeConverter(typeof(...))] attributes and references compile.

Net48 public types present 870->890 (missing 164->144). Full suite green at 2342
(+7 tests).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
